                                "example_id": "8bbd9040-8f75-4feb-979d-1e9a38e7133f",
                                "sense_id": "418e45b6-44b9-3fe8-befb-a264c40a9cc6",
                                "text": "In zijn beroemde boek, \"Herfsttij der Middeleeuwen\", beschreef de twintigste-eeuwse historicus Johan Huizinga de Lage Landen op de vooravond van de Renaissance.",
                                "translation": "In his famous book The Waning of the Middle Ages the twentieth-century historian Johan Huizinga described the Low Countries on the eve of the Renaissance.",
